    "name":  "Linear LED Fixture 24W - STELLAR - Interconnectable - 60cm",
    "reference":  "LN24W- 92093",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover the \u003cstrong\u003eSTELLAR 24W LED Linear Fixture 120CM\u003c/strong\u003e. Its \u003cstrong\u003einterconnectable design\u003c/strong\u003e offers total flexibility with \u003cstrong\u003estraight, vertical, and horizontal connection options to the left and right\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing customized and hassle-free installation.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIncludes all necessary accessories: 220V input connector, interconnector, and surface installation kit.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAdditionally, its input connector can rotate up to 180º for precise adjustment. The fixture ends allow light to pass through, creating a continuous and sophisticated visual effect. Ideal for modern and professional environments seeking high-impact lighting with simple installation.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eLinear LED Fixture 24W - STELLAR - Interconnectable - 60cm\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover the \u003cstrong\u003eSTELLAR 24W Linear LED Batten 60CM\u003c/strong\u003e, the ultimate flexible high-impact lighting solution for modern professional spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Interconnectable Design:\u003c/strong\u003e Straight, vertical, horizontal connections - left or right. Modular system for custom configurations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Accessories Included:\u003c/strong\u003e 220V input connector, interconnector, surface installation kit.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Rotating Connector:\u003c/strong\u003e Input connector rotates up to 180º.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Installation Versatility:\u003c/strong\u003e Can transform into pendant linear lamp with hanging kit (Ref: SK92095).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Continuous Visual Effect:\u003c/strong\u003e Ends allow light passage for sophisticated continuous effect.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- High-Impact Lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e 24W power, bright and efficient.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUses:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eModern professional environments, commercial spaces, exhibition areas, residential.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFactorLED guarantees QUALITY warranty.\u003c/p\u003e",
